DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41564::$$$message_0313_0000_0000$$$::"Leysritt's primary weapon is a halberd."[lr]::
41565::$$$message_0313_0000_0001$$$::It's a polearm with an axe blade, like you'd see in an RPG.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=400 storage=凛巫女服02a(中) last=凛巫女服01a(中)]I'll let you explain this weird weapon."::
41566::$$$message_0313_0001_0000$$$::"...Are you sure?"::
41567::$$$message_0313_0002_0000$$$::"You got this!"::
41568::$$$message_0313_0003_0000$$$::"Very well. [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01g(中) last=アーチャー神主01i(中)]I accept this duty."::
41569::$$$message_0313_0004_0000$$$::"As you might surmise, a halberd is capable of thrusting, cutting, and blunt strikes, but it is much less capable at this than more common but specialized weapons such as spears, swords, and axes."::
41570::$$$message_0313_0005_0000$$$::"This weapon is specialized in breaking the opponent's stance and pulling them to the ground. [wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01a(近) textoff=0]In essence, it is designed to render the opponent vulnerable to a coup de grace."::
41571::$$$message_0313_0006_0000$$$::"The shape of its blades is suited to pulling a mounted enemy from their mount. Halberds are meant to be easily wielded for this purpose..."::
41572::$$$message_0313_0007_0000$$$::"But this halberd goes beyond such considerations.[lr]::
41573::$$$message_0313_0007_0001$$$::For one, it's too heavy for a man to swing. [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01b(近)]It's simply an inhuman weapon."::
41574::$$$message_0313_0008_0000$$$::"If a rational Servant picked up this weapon, he would deem it impractical and immediately discard it. It would be better to fight [font italic=true]bare-handed[font italic=false]."::
41575::$$$message_0313_0009_0000$$$::"But this halberd is wielded by an Einzbern homunculus."::
41576::$$$message_0313_0010_0000$$$::"They do not experience fatigue, and they can match Servants in pure muscular strength. No, they might even surpass us...but their threat level is a separate topic. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Let us return to the halberd."::
41577::$$$message_0313_0011_0000$$$::"At a glance, this halberd appears not unlike an antique decoration you might see on a castle wall, but there's no doubt that it was created using the Einzberns' state-of-the-art technology."::
41578::$$$message_0313_0012_0000$$$::"It goes without saying that they've enchanted it with a variety of magical attributes.[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01c(近)]If a homunculus is meant to face an opponent with multiple weapons or a Noble Phantasm..."::
41579::$$$message_0313_0013_0000$$$::"Its weapon would need to prioritize durability over sharpness. In other words...[br]It would be forged with an emphasis on defense and surviving clashes. It is armor intended for offense."::
41580::$$$message_0313_0014_0000$$$::"Offensive armor...sounds like an oxymoron."::
41581::$$$message_0313_0015_0000$$$::"...Indeed. [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][loopmove both=1 time=1200 path=(518,127,255,1000)(537,144,255,1000)(559,144,255,1000)(583,127,255,1000)(559,144,255,1000)(537,144,255,1000)(518,127,255,1000) mover=RestiveMover storage=凛巫女服01m(遠) accel=1 frame=1 decel=2 spline=1][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01a(近)]One suitable material would be the tungsten steel used in armor-piercing ammunition, but there's a metal that's even better: [wvl canskip=0 time=400]rhenium."::
41582::$$$message_0313_0016_0000$$$::"Rhenium is far rarer and more expensive than tungsten, but that is no concern to the Einzberns."::
41583::$$$message_0313_0017_0000$$$::"Supposedly named after the Rhine River, rhenium-based alloys are more durable than tungsten. Rhenium weapons are ideal for the utterly unbalanced homunculi."::
41584::$$$message_0313_0018_0000$$$::"...Is it that heavy?"::
41585::$$$message_0313_0019_0000$$$::"Extremely.[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01e(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01e(近)]It's three times heavier than iron, and heavier than lead and gold..."::
41586::$$$message_0313_0020_0000$$$::"Can you imagine being struck by such a weapon?[lr]::
41587::$$$message_0313_0020_0001$$$::No, you can't. That alone makes their foes underestimate them."::
41588::$$$message_0313_0021_0000$$$::"The homunculi are beautiful in appearance, but they wield weapons unseen in the history of war. That is what truly makes them inspire terror."::
41589::$$$message_0313_0022_0000$$$::"You're talking like you just dueled one."::
41590::$$$message_0313_0023_0000$$$::"...No."::
41591::$$$message_0313_0024_0000$$$::"I've dreamed of owning such a weapon...[br]So I just let my imagination take over."::
41592::$$$message_0313_0025_0000$$$::"...!"[wm canskip=0]::

